{
    "openapi": "3.1.0",
    "info": {
        "title": "AIProjectManager Mini App API",
        "description": "REST API \u0434\u043b\u044f Telegram Mini App.\n\n**\u0410\u0443\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u0444\u0438\u043a\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f** \u2014 \u0437\u0430\u0433\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0432\u043e\u043a `X-Telegram-Init-Data` \u0441\u043e \u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043a\u043e\u0439 `initData` \u0438\u0437 `window.Telegram.WebApp.initData` (HMAC-SHA256, \u043f\u043e\u0434\u043f\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043d \u0431\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c).\n\u0412\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f \u0436\u0438\u0437\u043d\u0438 initData \u2014 24 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0430.\n\n\u0412 dev-\u0440\u0435\u0436\u0438\u043c\u0435 (`MINIAPP_DEV_MODE=true`) \u0432\u043c\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043e initData \u043c\u043e\u0436\u043d\u043e \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0437\u0430\u0433\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0432\u043e\u043a `X-Dev-Telegram-User-Id` \u0441 \u0447\u0438\u0441\u043b\u043e\u0432\u044b\u043c Telegram ID \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f.\n",
        "contact": {
            "name": "AIProjectManager Team"
        },
        "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    "servers": [
        {
            "url": "http://localhost:8081",
            "description": "Generated server url"
        }
    ],
    "security": [
        {
            "TelegramAuth": []
        }
    ],
    "tags": [
        {
            "name": "YouGile Integration",
            "description": "\u041f\u043e\u0434\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0438 \u0443\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0438\u043d\u0442\u0435\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0435\u0439 \u0441 YouGile"
        },
        {
            "name": "User",
            "description": "\u041f\u0440\u043e\u0444\u0438\u043b\u044c \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f"
        },
        {
            "name": "Settings",
            "description": "\u041d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0438 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f"
        },
        {
            "name": "Tasks",
            "description": "\u0417\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0438 \u0442\u0435\u043a\u0443\u0449\u0435\u0439 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u043a\u0438 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f"
        }
    ],
    "paths": {
        "/api/v1/integrations/yougile/boards/{boardId}/select": {
            "put": {
                "tags": [
                    "YouGile Integration"
                ],
                "summary": "\u0412\u044b\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0434\u043e\u0441\u043a\u0443",
                "description": "\u0423\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0443\u043a\u0430\u0437\u0430\u043d\u043d\u0443\u044e \u0434\u043e\u0441\u043a\u0443 \u043a\u0430\u043a \u0442\u0435\u043a\u0443\u0449\u0443\u044e \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f. \u0417\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0438 \u0432 `/api/v1/tasks` \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0443\u0442 \u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0441 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0439 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u043a\u0438.",
                "operationId": "selectBoard",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "boardId",
                        "in": "path",
                        "description": "ID \u0434\u043e\u0441\u043a\u0438 \u0432 YouGile",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "\u0414\u043e\u0441\u043a\u0430 \u0432\u044b\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0430"
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "\u041d\u0435 \u0430\u0443\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u0444\u0438\u0446\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "example": {
                                        "error": "Missing X-Telegram-Init-Data header"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "\u0414\u043e\u0441\u043a\u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0439\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0430",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "example": {
                                        "error": "Board not found"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/integrations/yougile/connect": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "YouGile Integration"
                ],
                "summary": "\u041f\u043e\u0434\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044c YouGile \u0430\u043a\u043a\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0442",
                "description": "\u041f\u043e\u0434\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0430\u0435\u0442 YouGile \u0430\u043a\u043a\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f.\n\n**\u0428\u0430\u0433 1**: \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0430\u0442\u044c `email` + `password` \u0431\u0435\u0437 `companyId`.\n\u0415\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u0443 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f \u043d\u0435\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u043a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0439, \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043d\u0451\u0442\u0441\u044f `requiresCompanySelection: true`\n\u0438 \u0441\u043f\u0438\u0441\u043e\u043a \u043a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0439.\n\n**\u0428\u0430\u0433 2**: \u043f\u043e\u0432\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0437\u0430\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441 \u0441 \u0442\u0435\u043c \u0436\u0435 `email`/`password` \u0438 \u0432\u044b\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u043c `companyId`.\n\u041f\u0440\u0438 \u0443\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0445\u0435 `connected: true` \u0438 \u0441\u043f\u0438\u0441\u043e\u043a \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u043e\u043a.\n",
                "operationId": "connect",
                "requestBody": {
                    "description": "\u0423\u0447\u0451\u0442\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 YouGile",
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConnectRequest"
                            },
                            "examples": {
                                "\u0428\u0430\u0433 1 \u2014 \u0431\u0435\u0437 companyId": {
                                    "description": "\u0428\u0430\u0433 1 \u2014 \u0431\u0435\u0437 companyId",
                                    "value": {
                                        "email": "user@example.com",
                                        "password": "secret"
                                    }
                                },
                                "\u0428\u0430\u0433 2 \u2014 \u0441 companyId": {
                                    "description": "\u0428\u0430\u0433 2 \u2014 \u0441 companyId",
                                    "value": {
                                        "email": "user@example.com",
                                        "password": "secret",
                                        "companyId": "c1"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "required": true
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "\u0420\u0435\u0437\u0443\u043b\u044c\u0442\u0430\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConnectResponse"
                                },
                                "examples": {
                                    "\u041e\u0434\u043d\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f \u2014 \u0443\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0445": {
                                        "description": "\u041e\u0434\u043d\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f \u2014 \u0443\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0445",
                                        "value": {
                                            "connected": true,
                                            "requiresCompanySelection": false,
                                            "companies": [],
                                            "boards": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "board-uuid",
                                                    "name": "\u0411\u044d\u043a\u043b\u043e\u0433",
                                                    "isDefault": true
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "\u041d\u0435\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u043a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0439": {
                                        "description": "\u041d\u0435\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u043a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0439",
                                        "value": {
                                            "connected": false,
                                            "requiresCompanySelection": true,
                                            "companies": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "c1",
                                                    "name": "\u041a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0410"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "c2",
                                                    "name": "\u041a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0411"
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "boards": []
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "\u041d\u0435\u0432\u0435\u0440\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0443\u0447\u0451\u0442\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "example": {
                                        "error": "Invalid credentials"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "\u041d\u0435 \u0430\u0443\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u0444\u0438\u0446\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "example": {
                                        "error": "Missing X-Telegram-Init-Data header"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/tasks/{taskId}/status": {
            "patch": {
                "tags": [
                    "Tasks"
                ],
                "summary": "\u041e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u0443\u0441 \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0438",
                "description": "\u041c\u0435\u043d\u044f\u0435\u0442 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u0443\u0441 \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0438 \u043f\u043e \u0435\u0451 ID. \u0414\u043e\u043f\u0443\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043c\u044b\u0435 \u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f: `TODO`, `IN_PROGRESS`, `REVIEW`, `DONE`.",
                "operationId": "updateStatus",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "taskId",
                        "in": "path",
                        "description": "ID \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0438 \u0432 YouGile",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "requestBody": {
                    "description": "\u041d\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0439 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u0443\u0441",
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UpdateTaskStatusRequest"
                            },
                            "example": {
                                "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "required": true
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "\u041e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0451\u043d\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0430",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskDto"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "\u041d\u0435 \u0430\u0443\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u0444\u0438\u0446\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "example": {
                                        "error": "Invalid or expired init data"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "\u0417\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0439\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0430",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "example": {
                                        "error": "Task not found"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/settings/notifications": {
            "get": {
                "tags": [
                    "Settings"
                ],
                "summary": "\u041f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0438 \u0443\u0432\u0435\u0434\u043e\u043c\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439",
                "description": "\u0412\u043e\u0437\u0432\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u043a\u0443\u0449\u0438\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0438 Telegram-\u0443\u0432\u0435\u0434\u043e\u043c\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f.",
                "operationId": "getNotifications",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "\u041d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0438 \u0443\u0432\u0435\u0434\u043e\u043c\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NotificationSettingsResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "\u041d\u0435 \u0430\u0443\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u0444\u0438\u0446\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "example": {
                                        "error": "Missing X-Telegram-Init-Data header"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            "patch": {
                "tags": [
                    "Settings"
                ],
                "summary": "\u041e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0438 \u0443\u0432\u0435\u0434\u043e\u043c\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439",
                "description": "\u0418\u0437\u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f\u0435\u0442 \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0438 \u0443\u0432\u0435\u0434\u043e\u043c\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439. \u041f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0442\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044f, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u0435 \u043d\u0443\u0436\u043d\u043e \u0438\u0437\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0442\u044c.",
                "operationId": "updateNotifications",
                "requestBody": {
                    "description": "\u041f\u043e\u043b\u044f \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f (null-\u043f\u043e\u043b\u044f \u0438\u0433\u043d\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e\u0442\u0441\u044f)",
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NotificationSettingsRequest"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "required": true
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "\u041e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0451\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0438",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NotificationSettingsResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "\u041d\u0435 \u0430\u0443\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u0444\u0438\u0446\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "string",
                                    "example": {
                                        "error": "Missing X-Telegram-Init-Data header"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/user/profile": {
            "get": {
                "tags": [
                    "User"
                ],
                "summary": "\u041f\u0440\u043e\u0444\u0438\u043b\u044c \u0442\u0435\u043a\u0443\u0449\u0435\u0433\u043e \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f",
                "description": "\u0412\u043e\u0437\u0432\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0444\u0438\u043b\u044c \u0430\u0443\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u0444\u0438\u0446\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f: Telegram-\u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435, \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u0443\u0441 \u0438\u043d\u0442\u0435\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0438 \u0441 YouGile \u0438 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0443 \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447.",
                "operationId": "getProfile",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "\u041f\u0440\u043e\u0444\u0438\u043b\u044c \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProfileResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "\u041d\u0435 \u0430\u0443\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u0444\u0438\u0446\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d",
                        "content": {
                            "*/*": {
